{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他刚沉进满足里，熟悉的生活感忽然闯来，身体先绷紧，回神后又懊恼自己忘了还有事要面对。\",\n      \"key\": \"熟悉的生活感\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"珍惜的东西仍受威胁，他又想起当初不肯再等，光怀念护不住那种生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"当初不肯再等\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想重新投入，却怕又把累当软弱，硬撑到头会磨掉温柔，只剩一股蛮劲，连争取的心也没了。\",\n      \"key\": \"磨掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他原以为想明白行动的理由就能安心，如今理由和顾虑都多了，反倒更难定心。\",\n      \"key\": \"理由和顾虑\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R32\", \"R35\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留安宁中忽然闯回的熟悉生活感，以及回神后懊恼自己忘了还有事要面对的认识；让惊醒与自责留在同一段心理过程中，不再拆成重复条目。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R33\", \"R34\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把眼下珍惜之物仍受威胁的事实与当初不肯再等的理由接起来，让行动的必要性来自他亲自认下过的缘由，而不是先讲抽象道理。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R36\", \"R37\", \"R38\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他想重新投入却无法再毫无顾忌的处境，并补回他怕硬撑磨掉温柔、最后只剩蛮劲，连争取的心也会失去的后果。具体前因改连 S05-4，说明他为何怕重蹈逼自己硬撑的覆辙；不再另写一条重复两难的对称句。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R39\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"精简\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他原以为想清行动理由就能安心，如今理由和顾虑反而更多、更难定心的认识。具体冲突已由前两条说明，这里不再重复温柔可能被磨掉的顾虑；同时以 S01-3 为前因，接回他起初想靠找到足够有力的理由终结犹疑的念头。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"这是对材料身份的另一种听法，不必与人物的主体验拼成连续心理经历，因此不强行补写人物原因。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c9713a75-55fd-479f-995a-8c80163bf796", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T120844201952Z", "elapsed_seconds": 481.719, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T12:16:45.940099+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "df12fec3fe23223f5050453b433454c1d802d639d0fe99614de7d0187a9ac6d9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T1208442